    {
      "block_id": "b00002",
      "block_type": "p",
      "text": "Monckton Chambers has 34 practitioners specialising in procurement law, dealing with hundreds of sets of procurement instructions each year. We believe our range of procurement experience and expertise surpasses that of any other chambers.",
